{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1504203-story-and-game-ideas","id":1504203,"title":"Story and Game Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-02T08:20:32-08:00","id":1504203,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Story and Game Ideas","content":"I've had some ideas for games and I'm pretty sure there used to be a forum post for game and story hooks that I can't seem to find anymore so here we go.<br /> <br /> I'll toss one of my ideas out first<br /> <br /> its basically a mix of Gunstar Auto and Exalted Modern Shard variant because I've been listening to a lot of HFY Humans are Space Orcs on youtube.<br /> <br /> The setting is similar to Gunstar Auto once everything picks up, the backstory is the same. The Primordials and gods all go through the same stuff up to the point that Auto is creating mortals, Auto created the Sol Solar System within a bubble that prevented essence as the rest of creation knows it from existing. Auto created a universe within a universe that operated on our laws of physics where the closest we could come to manipulating actual essence is through quantum mechanics.<br /> <br /> Then one day a Primordial created race finds the Sol System and find us, they are completely confused to the nature of this area and why they were no longer able to collect essence, eventually they came back with essence batteries to power their wonders, weapons, and defenses while they make contact with Earth. (I'm hand waiving a lot here because I'm not trying to right a full setting book lol, listen to some of the &quot;First Contact&quot; stuff from one of the channels that does the &quot;Humans are Space Orcs&quot; stories, Agro Squirrel is one of my favorites)<br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T13:00:56-08:00","id":1504289,"title":"","content":"If people on Earth don't have essence manipulation outside of quantum mechanics what's the PC's deal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-23T16:23:39-07:00","id":1509414,"title":"","content":"Basically, Earth, Terra, whatever you want to call it has a bubble around it blocking essence (there is actually a bubble around the real solar system created by the sun that protects us from the grater galaxy's background radiation). The hook is that a primordial created race punctures the bubble and essence starts trickling in. From there introduce the exalted however fits your game.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}